sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Vue as Study.vue
    participant Controller as StudyController
    participant Service as StudyService
    participant DB as 数据库
    
    User->>Vue: 点击认识/不认识
    Vue->>Controller: POST /api/study/result
    Controller->>Service: submitResult()
    Service->>DB: 保存学习记录
    Service->>DB: 更新掌握状态
    Service->>DB: 生成复习计划
    Service->>DB: 如错误加入错词本
    DB-->>Service: 返回数据库结果
    Service-->>Controller: 返回业务结果
    Controller-->>Vue: 返回接口响应
    Vue-->>User: 展示下一个单词
